<title>USA: Exporters sell 103,632 tonnes corn to Japan-USDA.</title>
<headline>Exporters sell 103,632 tonnes corn to Japan-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exporters reported the sale of 103,632 tonnes of U.S. corn to Japan for delivery during the 1996/97 marketing year, U.S. Agriculture Department said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The marketing year for corn opened last Sept 1.</p>
<p>By law, exporters must promptly report sales of more than 100,000 tonnes of grain to a single destination.</p>
